---
name: Rollup
type: ROLLUP
description: Group-by + custom CTL2 lifecycle (initGroup, updateGroup, finishGroup, transform). More flexible than AGGREGATE; multi-output ports.
tags: [component, transformer, rollup, group-by, ctl2, accumulator, multi-output]
scope: install
provenance: human-curated
sections: [description, purpose, xml, properties, ports, ctl, examples, mistakes]
